00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.200
Which in and of itself is a challenge.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.760
I mean, in Venom #9 Wolverine is able to heal after a nuclear bomb destroys a village.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.140
